# Python API

- Validate at the router (`HTTPException` 400), not with hidden defaults that change meaning.
- Serialize with `doc_to_dict` so `_id` stays camelCase for the SPA.
- Cron/tick jobs must be idempotent (unique keys / existing-row checks).
- One-shot CLI processes (`app.alerts_tick`) must close the Mongo client so the process exits.
- Prefer small pure helpers (see `app/alerts.py`) so scheduling math is unit-tested without Mongo.
